   293	
   294	Four checkpointed streams resumed, completed, and landed as four PRs:
   295	the integrity/provenance overhaul (all 31 audit-pinned defects fixed;
   296	strict validation now re-derives the power trace from raw evidence),
   297	the docs package, the KV-cache replay feasibility verdict, and the
