   299	~30 attributed catches: two blockers found only by fresh-instance
   300	lenses (a provenance hash that did not prove the actual generation
   301	input; a strict-gate bypass via mutable metadata), two pinned wire
   302	contracts overturned before hardware contact, one fabricated-evidence
   303	defect caught only at the lead's diff gate, two integration defects
   304	caught only by the post-merge integration review, and a crash path
   305	caught only by the final-head rule on the last commit of the night.
   306	Suite: 415 → 546 tests, zero expected failures. Roughly two dozen
