acy and hand-edited log bytes; the cure may not rewrite or delete historical supersession rows (D-156 residual Q2 historical-byte disposition (preserve and refuse; rewrite rejected)). Note: Registered 2026-08-27 in the 2026-08-27 T26 end-of-sprint kernel wave (docs/process_traces/2026-08-27-t26/WAVE-ROWS.md) from the lieutenant's draft (docs/process_traces/2026-08-27-t26/supersession-queued-rows-draft.md, Q4-B; the draft's proposed rank 17 replaced by the next A-number; the draft's line citations inputs.py:2337-2368, run_campaign.py:4766-4782, whole_window.py:4609 and :4700-4714 are at the draft's head and are replaced here by symbol names). Acceptance requires the divergence to be exhibited before any cure so agreement cannot be asserted tautologically. Soundness boundary that should precede future claim consumption; needs no hardware. |
TASK_QUEUE.md:666:| A102 | T0-REHEARSAL-PRODUCERS-01 | P1 Phase Gate | READY; GATES close: T0-UNATTENDED-01 [AGENT] | Make the ruled ten-gate supervised rehearsal actually evaluable against real window evidence by having the T-0 producers (scripts/capture_t0_step.py, joulewise/arm_readiness_evidence_t0.py, scripts/collect_clock_reference.py, and whatever mechanically issues the D-149 receipt) record the gate-bearing facts they do not record today, so a live rehearsal returns PASS or FAIL on mechanism rather than INCOMPLETE on absence. | Every rehearsal gate has a producer writing the evidence its evaluator needs, self-declared evidence is authenticated, and the evaluator's honesty rule survives untouched. Evidence: Every gate the evaluator marks UNRULED for missing evidence has a named producer writing that evidence, and a live-shaped fixture built only from what the producers actually emit evaluates to PASS or FAIL, never INCOMPLETE for absence; every entry of REHEARSAL_PRODUCER_WORK_ORDER in joulewise/t0_rehearsal.py is either discharged by a producer change or struck with a recorded reason; The six gates that today accept self-declared evidence instead authenticate it, each defect-shaped: G2's census is exhaustive over the on-disk T-0 namespace rather than a declared manifest; G3's HIDIdleTime witness carries argv, raw stdout, boot session and an in-sequence monotonic stamp, all checked; G5 evaluates D-149 C1-C5 from underlying evidence rather than declared statuses; G6 grounds the production-root set in the repository and proves ledger/roots/backup dedication as real paths; G8's agent-process matching catches hyphenated, suffixed and path-qualified spellings (codex-helper, claude-code, /usr/local/bin/codex-run); G10's positive control carries raw command output, timestamp, boot session and a hash binding; The honesty rule survives untouched: anything unevaluable is UNRULED or FAIL, never PASS; overall PASS requires every gate PASS; INCOMPLETE never counts as success; a regression proves a fully passing bundle with one gate unevaluable does not return PASS; No producer change weakens a T-0 refusal or alters the published clock.correct_and_prior_state.v1 PROBE value's key set; the live REASON_CODE_COVERAGE gate stays at registered 55 / produced 45 / dynamic 10 with the dynamic set unchanged, and no new reason code is added in either vocabulary without the exhaustive registration path in the T0 delta document's section 4.5. Authority: [MAGISTRATE-RULING-T0-UNATTENDED (the ruled ten-gate rehearsal); the ruled table is debate-sol-critique.md section 2(c); RF-26..RF-35 and the section 5 rule in impl/reason-code-coverage-delta.md](docs/process_traces/2026-08-23-t22/t0-unattended/MAGISTRATE-RULING-T0-UNATTENDED.md). Acceptance: [T0-REHEARSAL-PRODUCERS-01 acceptance](docs/process/state_kernel.json). Fence: Additive only: new records are added; no existing T-0 record's schema, key set, or refusal is changed; a producer change that alters what the arm-side predicate consumes is out of scope and returns to the magistrate (MAGISTRATE-RULING-T0-UNATTENDED scope (the T-0 evidence change is T0-UNATTENDED-01's; this row is rehearsal instrumentation)). Fence: Ed-hands items stay Ed's: the live rehearsal sitting, the privileged anchor positive control, and the sudoers install/exercise are surfaced as NEEDS-ED, never assumed (MAGISTRATE-RULING-T0-UNATTENDED (Ed-reserved items)). Fence: G7 is not this row's: the production consumer of the D-149 GO receipt is ruled to UNATTENDED-LAUNCH-01 (2026-08-26); this row must not build it and must not let G7 stop reporting UNRULED (UNATTENDED-LAUNCH-01 status_note (RULED ADDITION 2026-08-26: the GO-receipt production consumer)). Fence: Re-opens the T-0 author and the capture ceremony (joulewise/arm_readiness_evidence_t0.py, scripts/capture_t0_step.py) and therefore runs the full C-028 gauntlet: enforced WRITE_SCOPE, independent audit that never self-grades, severity-tiered refuters with distinct lenses, delta re-audit of every fix round; mutation-shaped auditing is mandatory (the T0 core round's five blockers were ALL found by deleting a gate and observing that its named test still passed) (reason-code-coverage delta section 5 (a green happy-path gate is not evidence a refusal fires)). Fence: The 5 s issuance bound is COLD-GATE-PENDING and must not be reinterpreted, relaxed, or implemented here, including as 'predicate recency' (cold-gate packet: ruling-status semantics (addendum: the 5 s T-0 bound)). Note: Registered 2026-08-27 in the 2026-08-27 T26 end-of-sprint kernel wave (docs/process_traces/2026-08-27-t26/WAVE-ROWS.md) from the S2 stream's draft (docs/process_traces/2026-08-23-t22/t0-unattended/impl/t0-rehearsal-producer-row-draft.md, written 2026-08-26 at the magistrate's instruction from T0-UNATTENDED-01's first rehearsal-evaluator audit). Forcing problem: the evaluator's first independent audit returned REFUTE because no producer writes the records seven of its ten gates need, so against real evidence those gates can only return UNRULED. STARTING MATERIAL, not a patch to apply: the killed fix round for the six self-declaration blockers is preserved at docs/process_traces/2026-08-27-t26/t0-unattended/p14-rehearsal-fix-round-PARTIAL-KILLED.diff (it left 21/31 tests failing and was reverted). Design round required before implementation. |
