docs/specs/c027/doc-008_state_kernel.md:80:| `authority` | string | yes | Exact value `AUTHORITATIVE_WORK_SELECTION_STATE`. The kernel authoritatively controls work selection only; it does not supersede checklist phase completion, decision-log policy, or evidence-artifact scientific truth. |
docs/specs/c027/doc-008_state_kernel.md:81:| `updated` | string | yes | Explicit `YYYY-MM-DD`; never generated from wall-clock time. |
