s W2, "the sharpest omission," because the re-freeze rotates the pack digests and therefore destroys the very baseline manifest that produced the audit; irreversible, so magistrate + Ed — regenerating truthful freeze-aware status text and thereby retiring M-2; then the successor arm packet, only after the T-0 repair passes end-to-end at the exact reviewed head. **Phase 3:** baseline-manifest supersession with the ruled fields, focused re-audit of the pack/custody-bearing seats, adversarial coverage re-enumeration of every universe, delta re-audits per C-028 on every fix round. **Phase 4:** a reconvened READY-CANDIDATE sitting with a fresh cold pairing.
