  3709	- **The falsely-clean attack (the F8 mechanism, executed):** the only seat that returned READY was the only seat attacked, and its READY did not survive. Three new blockers, including a **self-nominated coverage denominator of 16 against a real universe of 251** and an unbounded detector called under the writer lease. One for one against the method — which is precisely why the work-order program is recorded as not certified complete. (Evidence: `refuter-L2-out.md`; verdict Disposition/§E.)
