  3711	- **The fleet lenses (eleven seats, 46.7 minutes):** ten of ten gating seats falsified their own readiness. The catches no single-plane review would have produced: **L8** found that the machinery the arm-author gauntlet hardened has **no producer for its own nine inputs** ("the only 2am path forward is hand-fabricating canonical JSON"); **L6 and L7, independent from launch, converged on the same seam from opposite sides**; **L10**, the sacrificial seat, spent a synthetic window and found the claim edge unbuilt before a real window paid for the discovery; **L4** produced the charter's own type specimen — "the suite is green while the real seam is broken"; **L9** found both arm-time census probes unpassable on the real machine and named why CI never saw it (the tests fake the probe executor). The seat-level lesson: **the fleet's yield came from seats that execute against the live machine and the frozen bytes, not from seats that read code.**
