  3722	
  3723	**The pattern worth binding forward:** C-057's lesson was *a second reader of the same bytes*. This span sharpens it — **the highest-yield readers were the ones reading a different plane than the one under construction** — and the sitting supplies the strongest instance yet. The consult read the audit's authority structure while the magistrate designed its component list. The delta read the clock while the fix round read the code. The integration tree read the CI environment while three branches read their own diffs. The metrology run read the paper while everyone read the harness. And **the cold pairing read the sitting's own paperwork — custody, packet assembly, adjudicability, program ordering — while every other layer read the instrument.** Ten gating seats produced sixteen blockers about the machine; two cold seats produced four blockers about whether the verdict about the machine was worth anything. Both were necessary; only one of them was scheduled by anybody's instinct.
  3724	
  3725	### Deliberation resolutions and dissent
  3726	
  3727	The charter consult's rejection was accepted **in full and without negotiation** — thirteen amendments adopted, no partial adoption, no recorded magistrate dissent, and the rejected draft retained on disk rather than deleted. Where the consult and the magistrate's draft disagreed on the verdict form, the consult won outright: READY-WITH-CONDITIONS was deleted rather than tightened, and magistrate-alone READY was replaced by a mandatory cold pairing — the magistrate voluntarily surrendering adjudication authority over its own readiness verdict, months before the verdict existed to be surrendered.
  3728	
  3729	On the arm-author delta's F2 (the runbook has no author step), the magistrate **declined to patch in the implementation lane** and routed the documentation obligation to the chain-fix batch, which is where the runbook lives — a scope-discipline call recorded in #147's body and discharged in #148.
  3730	
  3731	At the sitting, three disagreements were resolved rather than averaged. **L1-B3's split verdict** (contract lens: should_fix; execution lens: blocker) was **synthesized, not majority-voted**: should-fix as a label, remedy subsumed into the blocker-gated kernel transaction, so the fix ships launch-gated either way — with an explicit instruction that the shipped work orders must not be re-registered and that P2-006 be retired by ruling rather than deletion. **The two cold seats split on M-2** — the adjudicator completed a merits analysis, the refuter ruled it not adjudicable on the packet — and the magistrate adopted **the stricter position**, remanding M-2 to its own future cold gate and demoting the completed analysis to advisory input. **The magistrate's own dispositions were partly overturned**: rationale point 3 of the drift disposition is stricken as false, point 4 recorded as over-reaching, and "the manifest requires NO fix" rejected by both seats. **No written dissent is filed**; the magistrate accepts both cold rulings in full.
  3732	
  3733	The clean stop at Ed's pause order remains worth recording: eleven seats were in flight, the sunk cost was real, and the session stopped, checkpointed, and accepted a fresh relaunch rather than contriving a resume. That is the disposition rule 11 exists to enforce, exercised without needing to be enforced — which makes its twin failure (twice acting on a stop-signal question before referring it) the more instructive, and is why it is recorded as structural rather than as two misses.
  3734	
  3735	### Process findings and follow-ups
  3736	
  3737	**The ~60-minute subagent-shell kill cap did not recur.** C-057's dominant tooling loss — four runs dying at 59.8–60.0 minutes with a `run_started` and no `run_finished` — has **zero occurrences** in this span: all eight manifested implementation runs recorded a `run_finished`, and the longest (`armauth-out`, 54.8 min) sat just under the cap. The mid-session operating rule adopted in T5 (long runs launch from the magistrate's own shell) is consistent with this outcome, but the improvement is **correlational at this sample size** and one run came within five minutes of the old failure mode **[UNVERIFIED-BY-MECHANIC]**.
