3603:### The rulings taken under Ed's interaction contract
3607:**M-1 RULED:** `BRACKET_SESSION_ID` for Window ALPHA = `window_alpha_YYYYMMDD-calibration`, date bound at arm. The runbook:177 convention reads `<WINDOW_ID>-calibration`, which would yield the plan-id literal; the window-letter form was adopted for operator legibility after the packet mechanic verified the operator binding passes the path-component check and that the margin recorder reads the plan-id as window ID independently. The arm packet and §12 record **both** the literal and the plan-id "so no consumer ambiguity survives."
