   564	
   565	Considerations: the mock vertical slice is the project's portability proof
   566	and CI substrate; keeping it dependency-free keeps it fast and unbreakable.
   567	Lazy imports turn missing extras into the structured failures the contract
   568	already requires, which doubles as a test of the failure paths.
