   257	   writes to a file in the bundle; `start_sampling` launches it,
   258	   `stop_sampling` terminates it and parses the file. Mock telemetry simply
   259	   synthesizes samples. Pro: real backends (`powermetrics`, `nvidia-smi
   260	   -lms`) are already long-running sample-emitting processes, so this matches

