  7914	apex-delegable reading let merges complete where the magistrate's own
  7915	last-look happened mid-gauntlet rather than last; separately, a
  7916	counter-review caught a branch falsifying a PAPER sentence — a
  7917	cross-surface fact only context-holding review reliably connects. The
  7918	terminal slot puts the accountable reviewer at the accountable moment.
