    40	## S9-01 — BLOCKER — the collector never records the analysis-manifest identity, so the `_v4` claim edge joins to nothing
    41	
    42	**Status: B** (rule exists at the consumer; no producer-side check).
    43	**Cure needs: CODE + W-LIST.**
    44	**Refuted by two seats with distinct lenses; both failed to break it.**
    45	
    46	### The chain, each link read at HEAD
    47	
    48	1. The collector resolves its analysis manifest by a fixed basename:
    49	   `scripts/run_campaign.py:195` — `ANALYSIS_MANIFEST_NAME = "analysis_manifest.json"`;
    50	   `:1201-1204` builds `config_dir / ANALYSIS_MANIFEST_NAME` and returns `None`
    51	   if it is not a file.
    52	2. Its version dispatch (`:1226-1240`) has exactly two branches — the AXI v2
    53	   schema, else the v1 validator. **There is no v3 branch.**
    54	3. The gamma pack ships `analysis_manifest_v3.json`, written by the generator
    55	   **only at the pack root** (`configs/campaigns/d117_contrast_qwen25_1p5b_vs_7b_v3/generate_configs.py:2110`).
    56	   `find configs -name "analysis_manifest.json"` returns nothing anywhere in the
    57	   repository.
    58	4. **The break is two-level, not one.** The window chain passes each numbered
    59	   *science-stage* directory to the collector
    60	   (`docs/phase_2/window_runbook.md:1456,1480`), and stages receive only their
    61	   configs and `order_manifest.json` (`generate_configs.py:647`). Renaming the
    62	   file would still not put it in the collector's `config_dir`.
    63	5. So `new_campaign_provenance` writes `"analysis_manifest_id": null`
    64	   (`scripts/run_campaign.py:3002-3004`) for every `_v4` campaign.
    65	6. At claim time the finalized manifest supplies a **non-null** collection
    66	   identity — `lineage.collection_manifest_id`, set from the prospective
    67	   manifest's id at `joulewise/analysis_manifest_v3.py:3646` and read at
    68	   `joulewise/analysis_engine/inputs.py:634` — and the cooldown join filters on
    69	   exact equality (`inputs.py:2143`, `:2191`).
    70	7. Result: zero campaign manifests selected; every bundle lands on
    71	   `campaign_cooldown_evidence_missing` (`inputs.py:3443`) and is ineligible.
    72	
    73	### Why it is not merely theoretical
    74	
    75	- **142 of 142** campaign manifests on disk across every `runs_*` directory carry
    76	  `analysis_manifest_id: null`. There is not one non-null instance in the repo.
    77	- The collector's own ratified contract requires the recording:
    78	  `docs/specs/c027/analysis_engine_trio.md:466` — *"Once `run_campaign` records
    79	  its `manifest_id`, a changed manifest is a different campaign design"* — and
    80	  `:1859-1861` states that null is contractually the **calibration** case, not an
    81	  alternative encoding for a production campaign.
    82	- The finalizer's own comment assumes the collector already did it
    83	  (`analysis_manifest_v3.py:3643-3646`).
    84	- `joulewise/campaign_provenance.py` (839 lines) contains **zero** occurrences of
    85	  `analysis_manifest_id`. It is unpoliced in both directions.
    86	- D-100 refuter R11 already observed this exact symptom on Window B — *"all eight
    87	  window B manifests carry `analysis_manifest_id: null`"* (`docs/decision_log.md:6228-6231`)
    88	  — and the installed cure only groups them under a `"<none>"` sentinel
    89	  (`run_campaign.py:4965-4966`, `:5373-5374`). **No fail-closed refusal on null was
    90	  ever added.** The one prior ruling that touched this did not close it.
    91	
    92	### Not cured by D-157 / W-10
    93	
    94	D-157 R-1 and R-2 touch the generator and the freeze/readiness path; neither
    95	names `run_campaign`. The current gamma prospective manifest has no `manifest_id`
    96	key at all, so there is nothing to record today — and after W-10 regenerates one
    97	**the collector still will not read it.**
    98	
    99	### Cure
   100	
   101	In `scripts/run_campaign.py`: resolve the prospective manifest from the **pack
   102	root** (the parent of the stage `config_dir`) as `analysis_manifest_v3.json`, add
   103	a v3 branch to the version dispatch, record its `manifest_id` into
   104	`new_campaign_provenance` (`:3002-3004`), and **refuse the campaign** when a
   105	production (campaign-policy-bound) run would write `analysis_manifest_id: null`.
   106	Regression: a v3 pack whose stage run records null is refused at the collector.
   107	
   108	### Sequencing note
   109	
   110	This defect fires on the **collection windows**, not on the freeze transaction
   111	itself — the transaction night's Phase G is dry-run-only
   112	(`docs/process_traces/2026-08-22-t20/real-transaction-runbook.md:1416-1418`). It
   113	does not have to gate the mint. It **must** gate the first collection window, and
   114	it is cheaper to land before the mint than after, because a mid-campaign
   115	non-config cure forces a new family generation (D-140 no-repair, D-153).
   116	
   117	### The meta-fact
