  3554	### The charter its own consult refused to ratify
  3555	
  3556	The magistrate wrote an instrument-readiness audit charter draft — "nine components, council mechanics, verdict form" (`a13b01c`, `…-charter-DRAFT.md`, 67 lines) — and then, before ratifying it, spent a rule-2 pre-decision design consult on it. The consult came back **`DO_NOT_RATIFY_AS_WRITTEN`** with **six blockers and two should-fix findings**:
  3557	
  3558	- **F1** — "The authority and state-kernel control plane is outside the audit."
  3559	- **F2** — "Component lenses do not audit producer-consumer seams or obligation completeness."
  3560	- **F3** — "READY-WITH-CONDITIONS and arm-time ED-SESSION closure form a fail-open path."
  3561	- **F4** — "A magistrate-alone READY verdict is not a trustworthy council decision."
  3562	- **F5** — "The post-collection path stops before claim consumption is proven."
  3563	- **F6** — "Operator-error and environmental-control completeness lack dedicated discriminating lenses."
  3564	- **F7** (should-fix) — lens boundaries overlap and dilute ownership.
  3565	- **F8** (should-fix) — "The mechanics verify raised findings but do not discriminate a falsely clean audit."
  3566	
  3567	Its own summary is the sharpest line in the span: the draft "omits the authority plane, producer-consumer seams, operator/environment failure surfaces, and full post-collection claim path, while CONDITIONAL GO and magistrate-only GO adjudication are fail-open."
  3568	
  3569	The magistrate adopted **all thirteen amendments in full** (`6a7849c`'s subject; the charter's own §Ratification: "magistrate adoption of the design consult's thirteen amendments IN FULL"; the consult document carries thirteen numbered amendment headings, count verified). The concrete deltas are visible in the ratified text: **READY-WITH-CONDITIONS is DELETED** (F3), **every council READY verdict requires the rule-11 cold pairing over a sealed mechanically-assembled packet** (F4), the fleet grows from nine components to **eleven seats** including the authority plane (F1), two independent producer-consumer seam readers (F2), a **sacrificial full-lifecycle** seat that drives a synthetic collected window through reduce → verdict → mint → claim consumption "proving the AFTER-window path BEFORE a window is spent" (F5), dedicated operator/environment seats (F6), and the **anti-ritual discipline** — evidence universe, coverage numerator/denominator, executed positive *and* negative probes with a mandatory READY-falsification attempt, unexecuted obligations listed, per-finding failure scenarios; "A zero-finding report without the full packet is UNVERIFIED, not READY" (F8).
  3570	
