  3664	
  3665	Charter amendment F4 made the rule-11 pairing mandatory for any council verdict: a **cold Fable adjudicator** (fresh session, no loop context) plus an **Opus contract-lens refuter** for cross-model diversity, both over the sealed mechanically-assembled packet (sha16 `e68c7fb9fe88ed0b`, 500 lines) with read-only primary-evidence spot-checks at `8937dec`. Both rulings are custodied verbatim; the magistrate edited neither.
  3666	
