point itself; every round-3/round-4 defect lives on the direct-call any-admitted-input contract. Ed's options are relicense with structural zero-threading, reverse freeze-plan Q7 and re-spec both packs' comparative cells to the worst-case default (costing the funded p256 prefill contrast's claim capability), or hold. (Evidence: `FREEZE-FCM01.md`; `fcm-refA/refB/consult/delta…4/fix…4-out.md`; `ed8715b`; `db3e212`; `123e8a5`.)
