  3723	**The pattern worth binding forward:** C-057's lesson was *a second reader of the same bytes*. This span sharpens it — **the highest-yield readers were the ones reading a different plane than the one under construction** — and the sitting supplies the strongest instance yet. The consult read the audit's authority structure while the magistrate designed its component list. The delta read the clock while the fix round read the code. The integration tree read the CI environment while three branches read their own diffs. The metrology run read the paper while everyone read the harness. And **the cold pairing read the sitting's own paperwork — custody, packet assembly, adjudicability, program ordering — while every other layer read the instrument.** Ten gating seats produced sixteen blockers about the machine; two cold seats produced four blockers about whether the verdict about the machine was worth anything. Both were necessary; only one of them was scheduled by anybody's instinct.
