  7709	   1.5B decode floor, fresh 7B decode floor, fresh 1.5B-vs-7B contrast
  7710	   — each with fresh §5A, live pre/post calibration receipts appended
  7711	   to the issued ledger, own verdict + head-pin + custody. Claims
  7712	   chain: historical corpus → issued D-079 acceptance rule → live
  7713	   brackets → prospective floors → prospective contrast. Honest
  7714	   framing preserved from the consult: historical data establish the
  7715	   RULE; live receipts bracket all claim-bearing science.
  7716	3. **Scope (Ed's decode/prefill directive):** prefill FLOOR cells ride
  7717	   both floor windows (cheap, same members' prefill phase). The model
